        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7902, Southwestern Cabinet Pull Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique shape along with the decorative nailhead designs of the Southwestern Cabinet Pull Backplate give it a rustic feel. It has a 3 inch center to center and a 4-5/8 inch overall length. This cabinet pull rose is available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull rose can be used with almost any cabinet pull as long as it has a 3 inch center to center. Highlight the rustic styling with either the <a href=\"/products/rustic-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-3710\">Rustic Cabinet Pull</a> or the <a href=\"/products/contoured-lines-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international-cp-92\">Contoured Lines Cabinet Door Pull</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/southwestern-cabinet-knob-backplate-rk-international-bp-7903\"><b>Southwestern Backplate For Cabinet Knobs</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7902, Southwestern Cabinet Pull Backplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
